      ],
      "explanation": "Electronic configuration of \n<br><br>Sm = [Xe] 4f<sup>6</sup> 6s<sup>2</sup>\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Electronic configuration of \n<br><br>Sm<sup>+3</sup> = [Xe] 4f<sup>5</sup>\n<br><br>Sm<sup>+3</sup> shows yellow colour due to partially filled f orbital and f-f transition.\n<br><br>Electronic configuration of \n<br><br>La<sup>+3</sup> = [Xe] 4f<sup>0</sup>\n<br><br>Lu<sup>+3</sup> = [Xe] 4f<sup>14</sup>\n<br><br>Gd<sup>+3</sup> = [Xe] 4f<sup>7</sup>\n<br><br>La<sup>+3</sup>, Lu<sup>+3</sup> and Gd<sup>+3</sup> are colourless due to absence of f-f transition.\n\n"
